{"seq":1,"slug":"framing-composition","title":"取景与构图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-camera-systems/framing-control/framing-composition","wordCount":1483,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"取景与构图\">取景与构图</h1><p>同一个角色站在同一片场景里，把他框在画面正中央、还是稍微偏左留出他面朝的方向，玩家读到的信息天差地别。相机不只是「跟着角色」，它在替玩家做视觉决策——什么该在画面里、摆在哪、留多少空。这篇把电影摄影的构图语言翻译成相机系统能执行的几何规则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>构图在相机系统里最终是一组<strong>屏幕空间的约束</strong>：把某个或某些目标点，约束到画面上一块期望区域里。引擎在 NDC 或屏幕空间（换算方式见 <a href=\"../foundations/camera-coordinate-spaces\">坐标空间与变换</a>）里判断目标当前落点，再驱动相机平移/旋转把它推回期望区。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  T[目标世界位置] --&gt;|投影到屏幕| S[屏幕落点]&#10;  S --&gt; Z{落在哪个区?}&#10;  Z --&gt;|死区内| H[相机不动]&#10;  Z --&gt;|软区内| SOFT[按阻尼缓慢回中]&#10;  Z --&gt;|硬边界外| HARD[相机立即跟上]&#10;  H --&gt; F[最终构图]&#10;  SOFT --&gt; F&#10;  HARD --&gt; F\">flowchart TD\n  T[目标世界位置] --&gt;|投影到屏幕| S[屏幕落点]\n  S --&gt; Z{落在哪个区?}\n  Z --&gt;|死区内| H[相机不动]\n  Z --&gt;|软区内| SOFT[按阻尼缓慢回中]\n  Z --&gt;|硬边界外| HARD[相机立即跟上]\n  H --&gt; F[最终构图]\n  SOFT --&gt; F\n  HARD --&gt; F</pre><p>下表是构图的核心术语对照：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>死区 (dead zone)</td>\n<td>屏幕中央一块矩形，目标在内则相机不动</td>\n<td>抑制小抖动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>软区 (soft zone)</td>\n<td>死区外一圈缓冲带，目标在此相机缓慢回中</td>\n<td>平滑过渡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬边界 (hard limit)</td>\n<td>软区外，目标绝不可越界</td>\n<td>防止目标出画</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>头部空间 (headroom)</td>\n<td>目标上方留白</td>\n<td>避免顶头压抑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前导空间 (lead room)</td>\n<td>目标朝向/运动方向留白</td>\n<td>暗示去向</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"三分法与视觉重心\">三分法与视觉重心</h2><p>把画面用两横两竖均分成九宫格，四条线的交点是视觉上最舒服的「兴趣点」。相机构图常把关键目标放在交点附近而非死正中——正中央显得呆板、缺少方向感。在第三人称里，这意味着角色通常略微偏离屏幕中心，朝向运动方向的一侧留出<strong>前导空间</strong>：角色向右跑，就把他放在偏左的三分线上，右侧留白让玩家看清前方。</p>\n<p>三分法落到实现，就是把死区矩形整体偏移：不以屏幕中心为中心，而以某个三分点为中心。当角色转向，前导空间的方向也要随之翻转，这个翻转必须平滑过渡，否则角色每次掉头画面都会猛地重构。前导空间的偏移量本身常与角色速度挂钩——站定时居中、高速时大幅前导，这与 <a href=\"../foundations/camera-follow-damping\">跟随与阻尼平滑</a> 里的前瞻是同一概念的构图侧表达。</p>\n<h2 id=\"死区-软区与软硬过渡\">死区、软区与软硬过渡</h2><p>新手相机常犯的错是「目标动一点相机就动一点」，结果角色待机时的小幅呼吸动画都让画面微颤。死区把这一类小位移吃掉：只要目标投影落点在中央死区内，相机静止。目标移到死区边缘，进入软区，相机开始以阻尼缓慢跟随、试图把目标拉回死区中心。一旦目标冲到硬边界，相机必须立即（或极短阻尼）跟上，绝不让目标出画。</p>\n<p>这套「死区—软区—硬边界」三段式是 Unity Cinemachine 的 Composer/Position Composer 的核心模型，也是大量自研相机的范式。它的精髓是<strong>把相机响应分级</strong>：小动作不响应（稳）、中动作软响应（顺）、大动作硬响应（不丢目标）。三档的尺寸是手感的关键旋钮，调它们属于 <a href=\"../craft-practice/camera-tuning-debugging\">调参与调试</a> 的日常。</p>\n<p>竖直方向常单独设更宽的死区或干脆吸附：平台跳跃里角色频繁起跳，若竖直死区太窄，相机会跟着每次跳跃上下点头。常见做法是竖直死区放宽、落地时才校正高度，必要时把相机竖直位置吸附到「站立地面」而非角色实时位置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"目标组取景-同时框住多个对象\">目标组取景：同时框住多个对象</h2><p>很多场景需要把多个目标一起装进画面：双人合作、Boss 与玩家、车队、对话双方。<strong>目标组取景</strong>（group framing / target group）的做法是：取所有目标的加权包围盒，算出能恰好框住它们的相机距离与朝向，再留出边距。</p>\n<p>距离求解的核心是：已知一组目标在世界里的包围球半径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 与相机的竖直 FOV，要让包围球恰好充满画面（带边距系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>），相机到包围球心的距离应为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>FOV</mtext><mi>y</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = \\frac{R}{\\sin(\\text{FOV}_y/2)} \\cdot m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FOV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当目标分散，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 变大，相机自动拉远；目标靠拢，相机推近。透视相机改 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>（推拉），正交相机则改正交尺寸。这套自动取景必须配合阻尼，否则目标聚散时相机会神经质地忽远忽近。下表给出几类多目标场景的取景倾向：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>目标权重</th>\n<th>边距策略</th>\n<th>注意点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>双人合作</td>\n<td>两人均等</td>\n<td>较大边距</td>\n<td>拉得太远各自看不清，需设最大距离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Boss 战</td>\n<td>Boss 高权重</td>\n<td>顶部留 Boss 头</td>\n<td>Boss 太大时优先框玩家可达区域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对话演出</td>\n<td>说话者高权重</td>\n<td>过肩构图</td>\n<td>切到 <a href=\"../craft-practice/cinematic-scripted-cameras\">过场与脚本化镜头</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>赛车回放</td>\n<td>领头车</td>\n<td>前导空间大</td>\n<td>与速度联动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>构图在实现上是把目标约束到屏幕期望区，判定多在 NDC/屏幕空间做。</li>\n<li>三分法 + 前导空间让角色略偏离中心、朝运动方向留白，暗示去向；前导随速度变化要平滑。</li>\n<li>死区—软区—硬边界三段式把相机响应分级：小动作不动、中动作软跟、大动作硬跟。</li>\n<li>竖直方向常单独放宽死区或吸附地面，避免跳跃时相机点头。</li>\n<li>目标组取景按包围球半径与 FOV 求相机距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>FOV</mtext><mi>y</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d=R/\\sin(\\text{FOV}_y/2)\\cdot m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FOV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>，聚散自动推拉，需配阻尼。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：屏幕/NDC 换算见 <a href=\"../foundations/camera-coordinate-spaces\">坐标空间与变换</a>；前导空间与前瞻的运动侧见 <a href=\"../foundations/camera-follow-damping\">跟随与阻尼平滑</a>；框住目标后被遮挡怎么办见 <a href=\"collision-occlusion\">碰撞与遮挡处理</a>。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：构图作为关卡引导手段见 <a href=\"../../game-design/level-design/spatial-composition\">空间构图</a>；HUD 与构图的图层关系见 <a href=\"../../game-ui-ux/hud-menus/hud-design\">HUD 设计</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"取景与构图","id":"取景与构图"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三分法与视觉重心","id":"三分法与视觉重心"},{"level":2,"text":"死区、软区与软硬过渡","id":"死区-软区与软硬过渡"},{"level":2,"text":"目标组取景：同时框住多个对象","id":"目标组取景-同时框住多个对象"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"坐标空间与变换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-camera-systems/foundations/camera-coordinate-spaces"},"next":{"title":"碰撞与遮挡处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-camera-systems/framing-control/collision-occlusion"}}